		<section label="Scrolling" sticky="stack" collapsible dividing>
			<example "Scrolling" description="A table body can scroll vertically: `scrolling`, with the head and foot stuck.">
				<message slot="description" state="warning" size="small">Some table variants like <link link="#examples-variations-column-width">column width</link> or <link link="#examples-variations-single-line">single line</link> do not work with a scrolling table. If you need such combinations use a <link link="#examples-variations-stuck">stuck table</link> instead.</message>
				<message slot="description" state="info" size="small">Add <text code>resizable</text> and a native resize drag handler will appear to the bottom right of the table body.</message>
